{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_title", "source_sha256": "0e6689f9e19a71b282c49d6b83398ccaf2f4f89e45875984d14a86592c8fb192", "ja": "約束の、その先へ", "zh": "迈向约定的彼方", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_synopsis", "source_sha256": "271121b8d2ced3a4a038318288a6ad1beccc8aec23be848b0aa99f197cf75313", "ja": "次の公演に向けてレッスンが進む中、紗代子\nはあるファンレターをきっかけに、アイドル\nとしてのあり方に悩み始める。だがメンバー\nと話す内に大切な事を思い出し、力強い足取\nりでステージに向かって行くのだった。", "zh": "在面向下一场公演的练习持续推进时，\n纱代子以一封粉丝信为契机，开始苦恼\n身为偶像的立足之本。但随着与成员们\n交谈，她回想起了重要的事物，以坚定的\n步伐迈向了舞台。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1000_p", "source_sha256": "381d9dc76f036e0da4339a7e4c99763ef7d7caba93e7514db44cad7fd8050cb7", "ja": "（定期公演のレッスンは順調に進んでいる。\nおかげで俺も、事務仕事が進められそうだな）", "zh": "（定期公演的排练进行得很顺利。多亏如此，我也能处理事务工作了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "1bb9c89cd5128515554b4f6f569f5c07cf8a1add23d3e848ae998779d6c6b54b", "ja": "{$P$}、レッスン終わりました！\nお先に失礼しますね！", "zh": "{$P$}，训练结束了！\n我先走一步啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f7b78af270c932ac7c792b683ef8b56a76e0503c48c11f5e670bdf168400250e", "ja": "お疲れさま、紗代子！\nおっと、帰る前に……。", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子！\n对了，回去之前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6035c1312a21075ef8b914858fd887740a2c667d552d5b8c6458b16214044e71", "ja": "青羽さんから、ファンレターを預かってたんだ。\nはい、これが紗代子の分だ。", "zh": "我从青羽小姐那里收到了粉丝来信。来，这是紗代子的那份。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "bc23f9b0c3cd7bfddb5035069992ca208f70904928ff2301915680d8b0da2766", "ja": "わぁ、ありがとうございます！\n……えっ、こんなにたくさん！？", "zh": "哇，谢谢您！\n……诶，这么多！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1005_p", "source_sha256": "9f7809788738a09ab5b860ef38ce3d4b0a3c7a3503dc190751601ce75e1ea9aa", "ja": "ああ。みんなCMの感想を伝えたくて、\n公演まで待ちきれなかったみたいだな。", "zh": "是啊。大家似乎都迫不及待地想告诉我们对广告的感想，等不到公演开始了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1006_027say", "source_sha256": "5f0836159274f79af014c14c41eaf2b7c36b1d92295458659bfb4908018f00e9", "ja": "うれしいな……あの、{$P$}！\nここで読ませてもらっても、いいですか？", "zh": "真让人高兴啊……那个，{$P$}！\n我可以在这里读一读吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1007_p", "source_sha256": "7257a9e5d5671184ba04f1dc87335fdabd693543f8c8b3f61c778266a38c03fe", "ja": "ああ、大丈夫だよ。\n俺は溜まった事務仕事をしているだけだから。", "zh": "啊，没关系。\n我只是在处理积压的事务工作而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "6473579c195053863b6d20d99bb191125def6b8f94d5d992d38191fa0f299096", "ja": "ありがとうございます！　それじゃ、さっそく……\nあっ、小学生の女の子からみたいです。", "zh": "谢谢！那我马上就……\n啊，好像是小学生女生寄来的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "2639efa2b7524e5fc64a34f01564b26875df5c2110b043d7f938e4fe462cfc92", "ja": "この封筒、もしかして手作りなのかな？　すごい！\n私のイラストまで描いてくれてる……ふふっ♪", "zh": "这个信封，难道是亲手做的吗？好厉害！\n居然还画了我的插画……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "d53478a71db61caae508e44c15e130933b374c601479e4b266ef23c458e5fed0", "ja": "「CMで紗代子ちゃんが大好きになりました。\n絵もかきました。私も勉強がんばります！」……わあ！", "zh": "“因为广告而变得最喜欢纱代子姐姐了。\n我也画了画。我也会努力学习的！”……哇啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1011_p", "source_sha256": "6e12c28c108dcd26a2ec8e1ad90b63970e91ab59081f4c01c331544c3bb7ca12", "ja": "小学生でも、塾へ行く子は多いから……紗代子みたいな\nお姉さんに応援されて、嬉しかったんだな。", "zh": "现在小学生上补习班的也挺多……能得到像纱代子这样的大姐姐加油打气，一定很开心吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "97a0b98f8b23e5ccaf4f5fb9211d3b925e95106093e611d9c244a699c9cd61e8", "ja": "お姉さん……ふふ、なんだか照れちゃいますね。\nあ、こっちにはCMの感想がぎっしり……！", "zh": "大姐姐……呵呵，总觉得有点不好意思呢。\n啊，这边也满满都是对广告的感想……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "8fa1779618464b7cd94225d746d548dc1db5d04b2cafb451dc1b2bb57feb2070", "ja": "「受験生です。勉強中に見ると、元気が出ます！」\nうれしいけど、勉強に集中できてるのかな？　ふふっ。", "zh": "“我是考生。学习的时候看到，就充满干劲了！”\n虽然很开心，但真的能集中注意力学习吗？呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1014_027say", "source_sha256": "a3ac0474ece163e193dae4a9345ff8e58f71ae8538e45c681f795e181243b0dd", "ja": "「新曲のフル、楽しみです。公演絶対に行きます！」\nわぁっ、ありがとう！　新曲、楽しみにしててね♪", "zh": "“好期待新歌的完整版。演出我一定会去！”\n哇，谢谢你！敬请期待新歌哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1015_p", "source_sha256": "a4c98f4b814b5d93241d9c41bc7a3ccd722dc3dc6afb1e3a811e47eb70939f43", "ja": "（……紗代子、楽しそうだな。\n公演に向けての励みになるなら、何よりだ)", "zh": "（……纱代子看起来很开心啊。\n只要能成为她为公演努力的动力，那就再好不过了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "683e0fb5953915078ddd39dad43f75c43e7361fb5eb44a9bbb69fae3700fe46f", "ja": "次が最後ですね。これは……あっ！\nいつも手紙を送ってくれる、高校生の女の子です♪", "zh": "下一封就是最后一封了。这是……啊！\n是那个一直给我寄信的高中女生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f9473c6f07fd95f2631888ecbb7083c474c6df824f80247a7eee204122fdcc13", "ja": "へえ、そうなのか？　紗代子のベテランファンは、\nCMを見てどう思ったんだろうな。", "zh": "哦，是这样吗？不知道紗代子的资深粉丝看了广告后，会有什么想法呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1018_027say", "source_sha256": "b6a5535e5965b732b87ac193744a006ad1a8b84bef35d633ea7921363b1843a7", "ja": "はい、気になります。……えっと。「こんにちは、\n紗代子ちゃん。ファンのAです」うん、知ってるよ！", "zh": "嗯，我也很在意。……那个。“你好，纱代子。我是粉丝A。”嗯，我知道哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1019_027say", "source_sha256": "92338d811e9d84bcef81d486eb72bb356428b50c9fe8ecf20a674113cc2ee5b0", "ja": "「CMと新曲が決まったって聞いて、すごく嬉しかった\nです。けど、実際にCMで紗代子ちゃんを見たら……」", "zh": "「听说你定下了CM和新歌，我真的特别\n高兴。可是，实际在CM里看到纱代子之后……」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1020_027say", "source_sha256": "0e0de0a018f1da375016e115f5ad5e9c9b10de0c35e4e0825c077f9e9dc8fc8a", "ja": "「なんだか、落ち込んでしまいました。私は\n紗代子ちゃんと同い年で、受験生です。けど……」", "zh": "“不知怎么的，有些沮丧起来了。我和\n纱代子一样大，也是个应考生。可是……”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1021_027say", "source_sha256": "14ebb0f76fcf72519cce688e266532bbd87ad1e503b15cb0a14a31d55da01f15", "ja": "「私は紗代子ちゃんのファンなのに、紗代子ちゃん\nみたいに前向きに頑張れない。ごめんなさい」……", "zh": "「明明我是纱代子的小粉丝，却没法像纱代子那样积极努力。对不起」……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "cfd8010029d22cc38b020394b272d38d31c2fbb08e2e594b84febad40fdb1de8", "ja": "{$P$}……。わ、私……。", "zh": "{$P$}……我、我…………", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1024_p", "source_sha256": "c058e6344d46c5abf61369f99e8e6654426d6be628fcd6198d63e6839ffb7962", "ja": "うん……無理して言葉にしなくていい。\nすべてを受け止めようとしなくても大丈夫だ。", "zh": "嗯……不用勉强说出来。\n你不必把一切都一个人扛下来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1025_027say", "source_sha256": "780a5ecb1645774fd8bd57bcc68491e6f49576e3f88d44f6b4ef07bbe1f28cb4", "ja": "は、はい。……あの、{$P$}。\n私のCMが、彼女を追い詰めてしまったんでしょうか？", "zh": "是、是的……那个，{$P$}先生。\n是我的广告，让她走投无路了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1026_p", "source_sha256": "6809e6b41c982cfa34e645e8dc4baad2837f1a60305be7789c37842a37e6b112", "ja": "理由の中のひとつではあるかもしれないけど……\n励まされている人が大勢いるのも、確かだよ。", "zh": "或许是其中一个原因……但确实也有很多人因此受到了鼓励。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1027_027say", "source_sha256": "84705c9f0116cadf42958f92ca9a02ecf5f85db2d5481c34cd91fdd9e910fe28", "ja": "はい……それは、わかっているつもりです。\nでも……。", "zh": "是的……我想我明白这一点。\n但是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1028_027say", "source_sha256": "5d33feec3758e05c981165cb2f61a674c00daf5fe5853d3fb5bdfcbfdc0381f8", "ja": "だって本当の私は、そんなふうに、\n前向きなんかじゃないのに……。", "zh": "因为真正的我，明明并没有那么积极……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1030_027say", "source_sha256": "e60067bebd1a71e53c0bea9b18e497ffd9cd2beeac96c86019740f32018d5eb6", "ja": "CMは、そういうお仕事ですから。私も、\n自信を持って見えるようにしてました。けど……。", "zh": "因为广告就是那样的工作呀。我也\n表现得让自己看起来很有自信。可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1031_027say", "source_sha256": "55ddbcdb22ff58c563b1ee32288eb6b34c1eb8b2c47cf70629d6e7cb7af92e09", "ja": "本当の私は、こんなにも自信がなくて……。\nいろんなことを、失敗してばかりで……。", "zh": "真正的我，居然这么没有自信……总是在各种事情上失败……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1032_027say", "source_sha256": "20f3cbe450807256d18903ff16cf5ecb3bc899070d5b102cad4d1055d164c5e8", "ja": "{$P$}。もしかして私は、\nファンのみんなを騙してるんじゃないでしょうか？", "zh": "{$P$}。难道我是在欺骗所有的粉丝吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1033_p", "source_sha256": "b5cc791dbdfdc1244357a21028237e0a4a88b3522ae0809e7409d6fbe0503d44", "ja": "そんな事はないよ。それにあのCMは、\nそういう仕事だ。紗代子が間違ってるわけじゃない。", "zh": "没这回事。而且，那支广告本来就是这样的工作。纱代子并没有做错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1034_027say", "source_sha256": "9f39d2803bbad0df18a53f36d74925aaf96f42b0cbb19b3a7fb7a032d329c46d", "ja": "けど！　……みんなは、私があの子との約束のために\nアイドルになったことを、知らないから……。", "zh": "可是！……大家都不知道，我是为了和那个孩子的约定，才成为偶像的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1035_p", "source_sha256": "78a002a9186db5edf6e3403f3ab554ed83dacc66dccf202b348eeae851b998c2", "ja": "約束……紗代子と幼馴染の子が、\nアイドルになろうと交わした約束の事だな。", "zh": "约定……是指纱代子和青梅竹马约好要成为偶像的那个约定吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1036_027say", "source_sha256": "a2c8df994dfab829f5203ad6554197f2c3623c524657767cd5575f02b0fee477", "ja": "はい……。", "zh": "好的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1037_p", "source_sha256": "cf1cf07c17a119f89350bb7cd059204707b7c3a31c325bbddfd335827c89c40a", "ja": "それはつまり……\n向き合う時が来たって事じゃないのかな。", "zh": "也就是说……\n是不是到了该面对的时候了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1038_027say", "source_sha256": "9b3d341a228f94c6b1b63b8b8bf60967df9f9204d954dbfbae49f4f908182ced", "ja": "向き合う時……？", "zh": "面对的时候……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1039_p", "source_sha256": "6ce77cab6eaffb3de92d11cbabd1b09aac680f787afa054eec02c30d398f04d8", "ja": "ああ。幼馴染との約束を支えに、紗代子はアイドルに\nなった。それはとても、素敵な事だと思う。", "zh": "是啊。以和青梅竹马的约定为支撑，纱代子成为了偶像。我觉得，那是一件非常美好的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1040_p", "source_sha256": "1b9ab50013e016a2eee4fd24567e66b4a78c80771f861098a2a43f28490578b2", "ja": "そこから、もう一歩踏み込んで考える時が\n来たんじゃないのかな。約束の先にあるものを。", "zh": "我觉得，也到了再深入思考一步的时候吧。去想想约定的未来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1041_027say", "source_sha256": "bbb8ff3dd6ef07dce83b5a798d53babc24f51ccacc918584ba61c039129724c5", "ja": "約束の、先……？　そんなこと、私……\n考えたこともありませんでした……。", "zh": "约定的，后面……？这种事，我……\n从来都没有想过……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1042_p", "source_sha256": "b2474a5361cf79c47e58b52dceade90a910b5c479d6e293c6490b07f0977a57b", "ja": "ああ。だから今が、その時なんだと思う。\nアイドルになった紗代子だから、考えられる事なんだ。", "zh": "嗯。所以我觉得，现在就是那个时候。\n正因为紗代子已经成为偶像，才会去思考这件事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1043_p", "source_sha256": "663c6c4a7fd436d9ecf7b0a63ff7dc3b45be1ea0f778b26ccd4d9c97840760ac", "ja": "もし、その友達と一緒にアイドルになれたとして。\n紗代子がその先、どうしたかったのかだ。", "zh": "要是能和那位朋友一起当上偶像的话。\n纱代子在那之后，又打算怎么做呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1044_027say", "source_sha256": "91c5a0a7c17596409fe92bfa3cbb8918e3bd8ded23ccc9a58661a4c7d6f992f2", "ja": "私が……どうなりたいのか……。\nあの子と、アイドルになって…どうしたかったか……。", "zh": "我……想要变成什么样……。\n和那个孩子，一起成为偶像……之后想要怎样……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1045_027say", "source_sha256": "3e3d4444b598226b8c477fb191a46e1bfce81f9a703cc48e9f06a2a6a7acee50", "ja": "私……今まで、あの子との約束を果たすことばかり\n考えてました。それだけで、いっぱいいっぱいで……。", "zh": "我……到现在为止，一直只想着要实现和那孩子的约定。光是这一件事，就已经让我竭尽全力了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1046_027say", "source_sha256": "2e4409d67d8535eac53bba4b0f50f37dae86875b88978c4a3dfb5ebba95410d6", "ja": "けど……今は……。", "zh": "可是……现在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1047_p", "source_sha256": "228fef1df198f651c5165d41ef38cd4d6478b036f71f77990073f887fe7cb417", "ja": "（これは「アイドルになる事」が目標だった紗代子が、\n初めてぶつかる種類の壁なのかもしれない……）", "zh": "（这或许是以“成为偶像”为目标的纱代子，第一次遇到的这类难关……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1048_p", "source_sha256": "bbaf90e404298f9ef7c928956b8ed507b7c0e61167275916c0fabd942876504d", "ja": "（けど、いつかは必ず向き合う問題だ。\n……今は、紗代子が出す答えを待とう）", "zh": "（不过，这终究是迟早必须面对的问题。……现在，还是等紗代子给出她的答案吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1049_null", "source_sha256": "0179841102665d2430c648ba7ed3e8e59068433a8599d739348856ae87db27da", "ja": "翌日――", "zh": "第二天——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1050_039kon", "source_sha256": "3368bb8f5b6db274c79035a482afc4ee72945982d6c1c8b7ac9672f70fb837b6", "ja": "うん、ステップはみんなバッチリね！\nじゃあ次は……紗代子ちゃん？", "zh": "嗯，大家的舞步都完全没问题！\n那么接下来是……纱代子？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1051_027say", "source_sha256": "a79ef991ee884eee83f87a7774f1ee2c2e829af9e626438bd0a8218335acb9a4", "ja": "えっ？　……あっ、すみません！\nえ、えっと、えっと……？", "zh": "诶？……啊，对不起！\n呃、那个，那个……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1052_001har", "source_sha256": "d5e6efe84182c06e1cb90d2fbfacbc2338424e33ee45eee52cac63bca5b8f031", "ja": "このみさん、朝からずっとレッスンしてますし、\nいったん休憩にしませんか？　紗代子ちゃんも。", "zh": "この美小姐，从早上开始就一直在练习，要不要先休息一下？纱代子也一起吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1053_027say", "source_sha256": "76b1dad97a5db38767050d1bb25c721ae89f8436b9048a02c183598b51d1e443", "ja": "いえ、大丈夫です！　私、まだやれます！", "zh": "不，我没事的！我还能继续！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1054_048rei", "source_sha256": "2c6879f2d24c1111bd1c0def0c999336c144f3b77b5e4d674f677a6011a008ec", "ja": "う～ん？　けど紗代子ちゃん、なんだかとっても\n調子が悪そうだよ？　元気がないし……。", "zh": "嗯～？可是纱代子，好像状态特别不好吧？看起来也没什么精神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1055_027say", "source_sha256": "3bb722778c10e1f4ebb964bff5b67f52a3eb48b2f525882618173d7e4b140900", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そんなことは……たしかに、\n上の空のときもあったかもしれません。でも……！", "zh": "咦！？没、没有那回事……确实，我可能也有过心不在焉的时候。不过……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1056_017kth", "source_sha256": "88584ec0aae388a0c6cafc4c96844affb65696f606491cd77ab2e529169cf16e", "ja": "紗代子が、とにかくがんばろうって思ってるのは、\nよく伝わってくるよ。けど……。", "zh": "我能清楚地感受到，纱代子一心只想着努力，\n不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1057_017kth", "source_sha256": "a3285ca83f58564a90fcc983428b0d4ea4542303cbbf60300e5fa6a9bb433e6c", "ja": "もしも、何か心配ごとがあるなら話してほしいな。\n仲間なんだから。", "zh": "要是你有什么担心的事情，希望能跟我说一说。\n毕竟我们是同伴啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1058_027say", "source_sha256": "2e120b3b8210ae89395c164e845016ba5b871564bcd842c27bebeb8949d3715a", "ja": "仲間……\nで、でも。せっかくレッスンの時間なのに……。", "zh": "伙伴……  \n可、可是，难得有练习时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1059_001har", "source_sha256": "79fee7d28294ca187e1650b380654e1032985c9ec58955cda579360449478137", "ja": "レッスンの時間だからこそ、だよ！\n紗代子ちゃん！", "zh": "正因为是练习时间，才更应该这样啊！\n纱代子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1060_001har", "source_sha256": "96e7cac39f02e01d90f04aebd8e64abc30d9b3b3130a2243d625a56469452b6c", "ja": "もし、それがアイドルとしての悩みなら……アイドルの\n私たちにしかわからないことも、あるんじゃないかな？", "zh": "要是那属于身为偶像的烦恼……我想应该也有\n只有同为偶像的我们才明白的事情吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1061_027say", "source_sha256": "216c7f68215da55a48fe6d8fbbb5958f19ccf07a8049ae0e268fe5b51cfab175", "ja": "アイドルにしか、わからない悩み……。", "zh": "只有偶像才能理解的烦恼……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1062_048rei", "source_sha256": "7c8e144294581f160fded7509518a4d5c7b7f2399cbb610c5a365e17ea8a2d6a", "ja": "それなら、私にも聞いてほしいな～。\nあっ、役に立てるかどうかはわからないけど！", "zh": "那样的话，也请听听我的烦恼吧～。\n啊，不过能不能帮上忙，我就不知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1063_027say", "source_sha256": "4737e5513893a77a3ddb9157a65fe86df9a17bc47b30c2c58039d8cdb3256785", "ja": "麗花さん……ふふっ。\nみなさん、ありがとうございます！", "zh": "丽花小姐……呵呵。\n谢谢大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1064_027say", "source_sha256": "1ae7e610e7ed6ca7d0c7ff5a0638df70c4b6c98553f90ba24e7beea227f426b9", "ja": "実は私、わからなくなってしまったんです。私は\n小さいころからずっと、アイドルになりたくて……。", "zh": "其实我已经搞不明白了。我\n从小时候起就一直很想成为偶像……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1065_027say", "source_sha256": "0a238769c08b574d7e37c7c3f926f82a6e7fd6687e817e31ca01ce2a9087a083", "ja": "けど、憧れのアイドルになって……その目標が\n果たせたら、その次はどうしたらいいのかなって……。", "zh": "可是，成为憧憬已久的偶像……实现了那个目标之后，接下来该怎么办呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1066_001har", "source_sha256": "56843e03e3cc97947570d43f4295f0a7f9b4ccca84ea05aced5ce5e7cc168727", "ja": "「アイドルになりたい」っていう夢が、\n叶った後の話かぁ……難しいね。", "zh": "“想成为偶像”这个梦想\n实现之后的事啊……确实挺难的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1067_048rei", "source_sha256": "22e78b6da2ee75e7c8e4f8ce82c932aee1243db1d609475ebe2da4c09aa660b9", "ja": "そうですね～。私も、ただ歌いたいだけなら、お母さん\nみたいにオペラ歌手を目指してもよかったのかも？", "zh": "是啊～。如果只是想唱歌的话，或许我也可以像妈妈一样，以成为歌剧歌手为目标呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1068_039kon", "source_sha256": "e158fffc5d4fc72d3a97b1acfef6b2c17811cd13055736507cd582d80d5aa452", "ja": "えっ！　麗花ちゃんのお母さんって、\nオペラ歌手なの！？", "zh": "诶！丽花的小光妈妈是歌剧歌手吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1069_017kth", "source_sha256": "f20b914b0d77cf495d13c4f83936281f3be2ce7eb7ae202d33537f883a3ac735", "ja": "し、知らなかったです……！\nでも、納得かも……。", "zh": "这、这个我还真不知道……！\n不过，好像也能理解了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1070_027say", "source_sha256": "853391bebf9db082110988be497b7f3eb5c0635693e93fbe295809f65f357ab1", "ja": "あの、それじゃあどうして麗花さんは、\nオペラ歌手じゃなく、アイドルになったんですか？", "zh": "那个，请问丽花姐为什么没有成为歌剧歌手，而是成了偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1071_048rei", "source_sha256": "6857ca8be63d8443b967322f577205871bace44e22a31b83056773174cb84ab3", "ja": "そうだね、きっかけは……どうしてだったのかな？\nでも私、アイドルになって、毎日とっても楽しいよ♪", "zh": "是啊，说起来契机……究竟是为什么呢？\n不过，成为偶像之后，我每天都特别开心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1072_017kth", "source_sha256": "82b416bc9d916bc4387cee403db3c997b4355cb6a58cc4d55a7465d757d478e2", "ja": "私も、最初のきっかけは舞台への……\nううん、アイドルへの憧れだったかな。", "zh": "我也是，最初的契机是对舞台的……不对，应该是对偶像的憧憬吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1073_027say", "source_sha256": "a1126ca7a8654c9b01161223612732cdacfccbc91bf29eac02015c560eb2b962", "ja": "琴葉さんも……あの、春香さんとこのみさんは、\nどうしてアイドルに？", "zh": "琴叶也是……那个，春香和好美，你们为什么会成为偶像呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1074_001har", "source_sha256": "e93975f10851322428ae5dfeb854b40883302db482a2852a339cbfff06ba9c7a", "ja": "私は、紗代子ちゃんと似てるかな。ずっと、\nアイドルが大好き！って気持ちがあったから……。", "zh": "我和纱代子有点像吧。因为一直都有着“最喜欢偶像了！”这样的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1075_039kon", "source_sha256": "e865b4dfef77a3f4e225d3c926fbc126277fc990885207de606102a44db8ef2d", "ja": "まっすぐで、まぶしい動機だと思うわ！　私なんて、\nそもそもアイドルなんて考えたこともなかったから。", "zh": "我觉得这是个坦率又耀眼的动机！像我这样的人，压根儿就没想过要当偶像。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1076_027say", "source_sha256": "78d3daf56da6a047f2de8710a9473f6f4aa3417d87cff103ff480dd2434598e4", "ja": "ええっ、そうだったんですか！？\nじゃあどうして……？", "zh": "诶？原来是这样啊！  \n那为什么……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1077_039kon", "source_sha256": "097d76d75d6924b1b6a8e05c81a8ff2f5ebc0a376486a9d509783224e48c505f", "ja": "事務員として面接を受けたはずなんだけど、\n{$P$}にスカウトされちゃって。", "zh": "我本来应该是来应聘事务员的，结果却被{$P$}先生发掘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1078_039kon", "source_sha256": "952729ca6c022644f2e848b710b7b3fc6d14e2d5180e7d2246bb072648e12946", "ja": "でも今は、せっかくアイドルになったからには、\n最高の景色を見てみたい！　……なんて、贅沢よね。", "zh": "不过既然好不容易成为了偶像，我也想看看最棒的景色！……这么说，是不是太贪心了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1079_027say", "source_sha256": "17ee392431ba249866bd7691ae0901764c4b634c114932e24b252490120eb21e", "ja": "そんな……とっても素敵です！\nこのみさんの目標、私も、見習いたいです！", "zh": "怎么会……真的太棒了！\n这也是我想向此美小姐学习的目标！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1080_001har", "source_sha256": "1057652c7cb9d26034dc4d5a03b9f56b874e86ba6291f01300b14a63314ca465", "ja": "歌が上手とか、ダンスが上手とかもあるけど……\n私、アイドルの魅力って、それだけじゃないと思うな。", "zh": "唱歌好听、舞跳得好之类的当然也是优点……\n但我觉得，偶像的魅力不只是这些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1081_048rei", "source_sha256": "ec45478ae697355983b4517aabe5b1d35da161c7525399dc3ff40ad4e2c012ff", "ja": "そうだな～。アイドルって、勇気をくれますよね！\n……あっ、だからアイドルだったのかも？", "zh": "是啊～。偶像会带给人勇气，对吧！  \n……啊，所以才会成为偶像的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1082_027say", "source_sha256": "3c33a4b070520c67c868645e71ae5e67c0511f81dcfe56c5a41c72a63018a799", "ja": "勇気……。", "zh": "勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1083_001har", "source_sha256": "518a0ab646143832e8eee2b79df0ce5f4ad7de3e909f1c6dbb2f1a179cbb7d85", "ja": "うん。仲間としても、見ている側としても……\nアイドルって、私たちに勇気をくれる存在だと思う。", "zh": "嗯。不管是作为伙伴，还是作为观看的人……\n我觉得偶像就是能带给我们勇气的存在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1084_027say", "source_sha256": "6627ab99f74c23be8b9f1b6e6b9404de33c53a7a0f0384aff5c312dda8a7e215", "ja": "小さかったころも、アイドルになってからも……\nアイドルが……私に、勇気をくれる……。", "zh": "不论是小时候，还是成为偶像之后……\n偶像都……给予了我勇气……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1085_027say", "source_sha256": "9da083ad86e54a9af735f7f1ed275b401a920c2343980e1b41ec2f26d775775c", "ja": "あっ、あの！　みなさん、ありがとうございました！　\n私……なんだか、やれそうな気がしてきました！", "zh": "啊，那个！谢谢大家！\n我……不知怎么的，感觉自己好像能做到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1086_017kth", "source_sha256": "6d7c21a06c73a06132558e4bd5d6c96ba13677f792968df995ef1732508eff63", "ja": "よかった。\n紗代子ならきっと、見つけられるよ。", "zh": "太好了。\n如果是纱代子的话，一定能找到的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1087_027say", "source_sha256": "b96bdef1da1baed37785b5d34cd69d3ebf0727a310e843be161a905b96889201", "ja": "はいっ！", "zh": "是！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1088_null", "source_sha256": "52b6761026c0c31ce96c6eb5398a3e6e922a8a9ca0e1d4c4afb44812df6a6585", "ja": "定期公演当日――", "zh": "定期公演当天——", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1089_p", "source_sha256": "826263afef9b5b188495eab9c8d9a861a08a5bf7ab3518f75c8e7ebb6290b8c4", "ja": "（いよいよ、紗代子の新曲披露だ。紗代子、\nギリギリまで悩んでいたけど、はたして……）", "zh": "（终于要轮到纱代子的原创曲初披露了。纱代子一直苦恼到最后一刻，不过究竟会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1090_027say", "source_sha256": "12b5cade289044a56df8364e43d2433695e94d3f42fc4eea96bc6ca980854c71", "ja": "{$P$}！　私、わかりました！\n私が、どうしてアイドルに憧れたのか……。", "zh": "{$P$}！我想明白了！\n我究竟为什么会憧憬偶像……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1091_027say", "source_sha256": "c7d420cbc1bcff6e27aaab787fbad4d5efba9c26fa3296c096a6ff8ffdaf81d1", "ja": "どうして、アイドルになりたかったのか……\nアイドルになって、どうしたかったのか！", "zh": "为什么想成为偶像……\n成为偶像之后，又想做什么！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1092_p", "source_sha256": "6fc07bb57652f3cec8fb062ab53d565e9e1f96958a7f0b2a0c18ef1d58d697d2", "ja": "！　……そうか。その答えは、\nステージで見せてもらえるみたいだな？", "zh": "！……这样啊。看来，你会在舞台上让我看到那个答案了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1093_027say", "source_sha256": "8f30a48edacccc325cffef240fcd4195e2b9076247cb0953c5ccbc28c949e85b", "ja": "はいっ！\n{$P$}、いってきます！", "zh": "好的！\n{$P$}，我出发了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_befo_080_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_080_1094_p", "source_sha256": "8bda64eb3eddcac70b7d667b6d7d028f9512adab42f96930ca5b200915834800", "ja": "（晴れ晴れとした笑顔と力強い足取り。\n今の紗代子なら、きっと……！）", "zh": "（灿烂的笑容，坚定的脚步。现在的纱代子，一定……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
